Project modifications include X2-specific robot integration, locomotion
curricula and rewards, randomization, history observations, expert-policy
export, evaluation, and a separate ROS 2 deployment integration.
The adapted MJCF changes mesh paths, adds foot sites, renames IMU sensors,
and adds a subtree angular-momentum sensor; the supplied mesh files are
unchanged from the source revision above.

Bundled policy weights are this project's self-trained research artifacts.
Official AimDK SDK sources, message definitions, simulator binaries, and
vendor-supplied policy weights are not included in this distribution.

